  "uploadNotes": "No information on male rabbits included in the study and so bucks are not included - average ratios of bucks to does could be 1:5-10 (https://www.canr.msu.edu/uploads/resources/pdfs/4h1464_4-h_rabbittracks_breeding_techniques_(1).pdf). We assumed a mortality rate of 10% as in Table 2 of the study.",
